{"id":24372,"date":"2020-06-24T09:29:19","date_gmt":"2020-06-24T08:29:19","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/?p=24372"},"modified":"2023-05-17T10:55:13","modified_gmt":"2023-05-17T09:55:13","slug":"how-to-install-and-use-the-phone-app-for-google-classroom-to-make-it-really-easy-to-do","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/how-to-install-and-use-the-phone-app-for-google-classroom-to-make-it-really-easy-to-do\/","title":{"rendered":"How to install and use the phone App for Google Classroom to make it really easy to do."},"content":{"rendered":"\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Installing <a href=\"https:\/\/edu.google.com\/products\/classroom\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Google Classroom<\/a> on your phone<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Several parents have complained to me about using Google classroom especially the sequence required to photograph our childrens work and upload it to Classroom.. it can be a several step process. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Here is an easier way, use the phone app &#8211; it makes it all much easier \ud83d\ude42  I&#8217;ve made a quick tutorial on how to install and use the app for this purpose. Hope it helps<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-medium\"><img decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/06\/image-14-190x400.png\" alt=\"Picture of Installing Google classroom app on your phone\" class=\"wp-image-24373 lazyload\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 190px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 190\/400;\" \/><figcaption>Install Google classroom app on your phone<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">So first its a trip to <a href=\"https:\/\/play.google.com\/store?utm_source=emea_Med&amp;utm_medium=hasem&amp;utm_content=Apr2815&amp;utm_campaign=Evergreen&amp;pcampaignid=MKT-EG-emea-uk-all-Med-hasem-py-Evergreen-Apr2815-1%7cONSEM_kwid_43700052081997946&amp;gclid=CjwKCAjw88v3BRBFEiwApwLevdyQiYBMdcUEV-VQX6yYuDHtn_RH2vH1Qte0WPoxK3MReuzR--SJWRoCLFUQAvD_BwE&amp;gclsrc=aw.ds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Google Play Store<\/a> and install the Google Classroom App<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">on to your phone.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Accessing the work that has been set by the teacher<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Open the App and choose the class you want<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-medium\"><img decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/06\/image-15-188x400.png\" alt=\"Picture showing selection of the class on the Google Classroom app\" class=\"wp-image-24374 lazyload\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 188px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 188\/400;\" \/><figcaption>choosing the class on the app<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">At the bottom of the screen you can see 3 icons in Google Classroom<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/06\/image-16-490x1024.png\" alt=\"Picture to illustrate Click on Classwork Icon at the bottom of the android phone sreen\" class=\"wp-image-24375 lazyload\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 490px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 490\/1024;\" \/><figcaption><br>Click on Classwork Icon at the bottom<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Submitting work to Google Classroom<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Grey means the work has been handed in and blue, still to be submitted<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-medium\"><img decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/06\/image-19-200x400.png\" alt=\"Picture showing selection of a particular assignment in Google Classroom\" class=\"wp-image-24378 lazyload\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 200px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 200\/400;\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Lets see whats being set for Foundation on Monday click the icon<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-medium\"><img decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/06\/image-18-188x400.png\" alt=\"Picture of the assignment in Google classroom\" class=\"wp-image-24377 lazyload\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 188px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 188\/400;\" \/><figcaption><br><br><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">And here is the list of all the attachments and video for the days class.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Click on Add attachment button, this is where you will submit a piece of paper that you&#8217;ve been working on<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-medium\"><img decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/06\/image-20-188x400.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-24379 lazyload\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 188px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 188\/400;\" \/><figcaption>click take photo<br><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-medium\"><img decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/06\/image-21-188x400.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-24380 lazyload\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 188px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 188\/400;\" \/><figcaption>Take the photo click OK<br><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-medium\"><img decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/06\/image-22-192x400.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-24381 lazyload\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 192px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 192\/400;\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">its done<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">At the bottom you can see the upload you just created. Your teacher can see what great kids you&#8217;ve been and you can add more documents.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/06\/image-23-481x1024.png\" alt=\"submit assignment on Google classroom using the phone app and adding a personal message for the teacher\n\" class=\"wp-image-24390 lazyload\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 481px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 481\/1024;\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">IF you want to add a comment or two about the submission you can write it here. Then press the &#8216;Hand In&#8217; button.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Its DONE. Any comments please let me know<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Installing Google Classroom on your phone Several parents have complained to me about using Google classroom especially the sequence required to photograph our childrens work and upload it to Classroom.. it can be a several step process. Here is an easier way, use the phone app &#8211; it makes it all much easier \ud83d\ude42 I&#8217;ve<a class=\"excerpt-read-more\" href=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/how-to-install-and-use-the-phone-app-for-google-classroom-to-make-it-really-easy-to-do\/\" title=\"ReadHow to install and use the phone App for Google Classroom to make it really easy to do.\">&#8230; Read more &raquo;<\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"om_disable_all_campaigns":false,"_monsterinsights_skip_tracking":false,"footnotes":""},"categories":[16],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-24372","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-education"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>How to install and use the phone App for Google Classroom to make it really easy to do. - The Excel Experts<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/how-to-install-and-use-the-phone-app-for-google-classroom-to-make-it-really-easy-to-do\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_GB\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"How to install and use the phone App for Go